{"id":105,"date":"2024-05-07T18:44:04","date_gmt":"2024-05-07T18:44:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/?page_id=105"},"modified":"2026-09-01T12:56:12","modified_gmt":"2026-09-01T12:56:12","slug":"tec-sup-en-mecanica-liviana","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/carreras\/tec-sup-en-mecanica-liviana\/","title":{"rendered":"Tec. Sup. en Mec\u00e1nica Liviana"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div style=\"--wp--block-button--width: 25;\" class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width wp-block-button__width-25\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/TS-en-Mecanica-Liviana-Res.-6248_03.pdf\" style=\"background-color:#0734cf\">Ver Resoluci\u00f3n<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"--wp--block-button--width: 25;\" class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width wp-block-button__width-25\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/horarios\/\" style=\"background-color:#0734cf\">Ver Horarios<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:55px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La\/el T\u00e9cnica\/o Superior en Mec\u00e1nica Liviana es un profesional que estar\u00e1 capacitado para organizar, programar, ejecutar y controlar las operaciones tecnol\u00f3gicas y administrativas vinculadas con la maquinaria liviana (su dise\u00f1o, operaci\u00f3n y reparaci\u00f3n) y coordinar equipos de trabajo relacionados con su especialidad.<br>La\/el T\u00e9cnica\/o Superior en Mec\u00e1nica Liviana estar\u00e1 capacitado para:<br>\u2013 Participar activamente en la organizaci\u00f3n de la empresa.<br>\u2013 Aplicar los principios cient\u00edficos que rigen el funcionamiento de las maquinas.<br>\u2013 Intervenir en el dise\u00f1o, reparaci\u00f3n y uso de unidades de maquinaria liviana.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Consultas:<br><\/strong>V\u00eda Whatsapp +549 2317 515076 \u2013 +54 2317 422305\/611071 \u2013 preceptoria@iseta.edu.ar<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>La\/el T\u00e9cnica\/o Superior en Mec\u00e1nica Liviana es un profesional que estar\u00e1 capacitado para organizar, programar, ejecutar y controlar las operaciones &hellip; <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":70,"menu_order":9,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-105","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/105","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=105"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/105\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1497,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/105\/revisions\/1497"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/70"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=105"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}